cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the SZL Holdings research thesis (Ouroboros Thesis v10) and reference this monorepo."
title: "SZL Holdings Platform — Governed AI decision infrastructure"
abstract: >-
  TypeScript monorepo implementing the Ouroboros Thesis (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.19944926)
  as a production-grade decision intelligence platform. Includes 34 sovereign
  innovations, 48+ API endpoints, the Lutar Invariant family v1..v7+Omega, the
  Audit Closure Operator Lambda_10, the Supreme Knowledge Codex v11, and seven
  domain product surfaces — A11oy (orchestration), Sentra (cyber resilience),
  Amaru (data sync), Counsel (legal), Terra (real estate), Vessels (maritime),
  and Carlota Jo (advisory operations). Stack — React, Express, PostgreSQL,
  Drizzle ORM, pnpm workspaces, Vite. Released under the Business Source License
  1.1 with a four-year change date to Apache-2.0.
